<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-MONTOYA STAYS IN TOP FLIGHT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MONTOYA STAYS IN TOP FLIGHT.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goalkeeper Carlos Navarro Montoya has remained in the Spanish first division by signing for second division champions Merida from relegated Extremadura, officials at the promoted club said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The transfer fee was estimated at 500 million pesetas ($3.3 million).</p>
